/-! The original electromagnetic gauge direction produces the joint exterior
charge of the dressed scalar--matter pairs.  The full defect `emFullDefect`
is retained by `original_generator_gauge`; only the actual `emGaugeAction`
component is read here. -/
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 2400000
set_option maxRecDepth 16384
noncomputable section
